Decode the DIA-PASEF MS2 frames of BrukerTimsFile::loadDIAStreaming() in parallel batches (Config::dia_ms2_decode_threads,
0 = up to 4 threads), like RawFrameReader does for the other loaders: the reader of the 3.7 pin decodes them serially,
which starved DIAspeXtract's pipelined tile reads at high thread counts. Same spectra, same order.

